        "id": "rk45-dense-events",
        "method_ids": [
          "rk45"
        ],
        "title": {
          "ja": "RK45の埋込み推定・補間・イベント",
          "en": "RK45: embedded errors, dense output and events"
        },
        "summary": {
          "ja": "減衰回転の解析解を使い、受理/棄却・FSAL・区間内補間・向き付き交差時刻を分けて検査します。",
          "en": "Use analytic damped rotation to test acceptance, rejection, FSAL ownership, dense interpolation and directed event times separately."
        },
        "assumptions": {
          "ja": "γ=.2,ω=3、初期値(1,0)、T=2。3対のrtol/atol×2最大刻みと終端交差2runで計8run。",
          "en": "Use gamma = 0.2, omega = 3, initial state (1, 0), and T = 2. Three paired relative and absolute tolerances with two maximum steps, plus two terminal runs, give eight runs."
        },
        "algorithm": {
          "ja": "実Dormand–Prince5(4)・quartic連続拡張・受理状態が所有するFSAL・保存補間上の符号区間二分法。拒否端点を昇格しません。",
          "en": "Use actual Dormand–Prince 5(4) stages, a quartic continuous extension, an accepted-state derivative cache and bracket bisection on retained interpolants. A rejected endpoint never replaces the accepted starting derivative."
        },
        "validation": {
          "ja": "解析状態とπ/6,π/2の単純交差を参照に、端点/97オフメッシュ点/イベント時刻・残差と実nfev=1+6試行数を判定。",
          "en": "Analytic states and the simple crossings at pi/6 and pi/2 provide independent truth. Check endpoints, 97 off-mesh samples, event times and residuals, and the actual identity nfev = 1 + 6 times the attempted-step count."
        },
        "limits": {
          "ja": "接触根・1刻み内の多重交差・reset付き系の一般性は保証しません。初期零/所有権/resetは限定成分対照で、局所許容誤差と大域精度を同一視しません。",
          "en": "There is no general guarantee for tangential roots, multiple crossings within a step or systems with resets. Initial-zero and ownership controls are limited component tests; local tolerances and global accuracy remain distinct."
        },
        "domains": [
          "time",
          "foundations"
        ],
